  "details": "VRChat does not have the ability to listen to my voice.\n\nI would like the ability to listen to my voice within VRChat to be implemented.\n\nIn 2018, I created a world called “Simple_Voice_Check” and used an avatar with LipSync as a Reverb function and was able to hear my own voice, but the specification was changed in a subsequent update and the gimmick to hear my voice is no longer available. I would like to see similar specifications implemented.\n\nPlease revive and implement the function of hearing one's own voice.",
